### Code Snippets

```
.tooltiptext::after {
content: " ";
position: absolute;
top: 100%; 
/* At the bottom of the tooltip */
left: 50%;
margin-left: -5px;
border-width: 5px;
border-style: solid;
border-color: black transparent transparent transparent;
}

---

.tooltiptext::after {
content: " ";
position: absolute;
bottom: 100%;  /* At the top of the tooltip */
left: 50%;
margin-left: -5px;
border-width: 5px;
border-style: solid;
border-color: transparent transparent black transparent;
}

